FONTS

Two serifs are bundled, and neither is mine or covered by either licence above.
Both are under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, whose full text is in `licenses/`
and must travel with any copy of the files. Neither declares a Reserved Font
Name, so the cut-down copies here may keep the names they came with — the OFL's
restriction is on names, and that is the clause that decides whether a font can
be trimmed at all before it ships.


